(7598078, 1227008, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous, the very heavy dark contrasts, the sense of speed, the light umbrella, you are immediately taken out of any country and think exotic. You feel wet, this is a 9!</td>', 'This is fabulous, the very heavy dark contrasts, the sense of speed, the light umbrella, you are immediately taken out of any country and think exotic. You feel wet, this is a 9!', '2018-10-03 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
