(7598086, 1227003, 118154, '<td valign="top">tottie</td>', 'tottie', '2018-10-03 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598091, 1227004, 81362, '<td valign="top">Although I look at an image first and only later consider the title, I do find a well selected title can enhance an image better than allowing the title to remain the file name via default upload process. When I look at this image, I find the bright sun on the upper leaves drawing my eye with no particular yield. When I scroll down to make a comment, the top of the photo gets hidden down to the middle of the large horizontal leaf on our right. Interestingly, that dramatically shifts emphasis to your little subject riding on the downward pointing leaf. But crop and composition is mostly a matter of taste and intent.</td>', 'Although I look at an image first and only later consider the title, I do find a well selected title can enhance an image better than allowing the title to remain the file name via default upload process. When I look at this image, I find the bright sun on the upper leaves drawing my eye with no particular yield. When I scroll down to make a comment, the top of the photo gets hidden down to the middle of the large horizontal leaf on our right. Interestingly, that dramatically shifts emphasis to your little subject riding on the downward pointing leaf. But crop and composition is mostly a matter of taste and intent.', '2018-10-03 14:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598092, 1226729, 81362, '<td valign="top">Massive ship contrasting with passenger leaning on the rail and appearing tiny in comparison yields nice visual drama and leaves us thinking about narratives to go with the situation..</td>', 'Massive ship contrasting with passenger leaning on the rail and appearing tiny in comparison yields nice visual drama and leaves us thinking about narratives to go with the situation..', '2018-10-03 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
