(7598573, 1227034, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really lovely.  This a symphony, an entire world.  The colors are gorgeous, the focus sublime.  That one antenna is in focus and one is less so is curiously appealing.  On closer perusal after the challenge is over I wish I had given this a 9 rather than a 6.  Sorry.  Whenever I under-appreciate an image, as I did here, I''m disappointed in myself.</td>', 'Really lovely.  This a symphony, an entire world.  The colors are gorgeous, the focus sublime.  That one antenna is in focus and one is less so is curiously appealing.  On closer perusal after the challenge is over I wish I had given this a 9 rather than a 6.  Sorry.  Whenever I under-appreciate an image, as I did here, I''m disappointed in myself.', '2018-10-10 10:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7598574, 1226801, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fine portrait.</td>', 'A fine portrait.', '2018-10-10 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
